  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#Breaker">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mechanical switching device capable of making, carrying, and breaking currents under normal circuit conditions and also making, carrying for a specified time, and breaking currents under specified abnormal circuit conditions e.g. those of short circuit.</rdfs:comment>
