  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#ExcIEEEAC1A">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">IEEE 421.5-2005 type AC1A model. The model represents the field-controlled alternator-rectifier excitation systems designated type AC1A. These excitation systems consist of an alternator main exciter with non-controlled rectifiers. Reference: IEEE 421.5-2005, 6.1.</rdfs:comment>
