  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#GovSteamIEEE1">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">IEEE steam turbine governor model. Reference: IEEE Transactions on Power Apparatus and Systems, November/December 1973, Volume PAS-92, Number 6, Dynamic Models for Steam and Hydro Turbines in Power System Studies, page 1904.</rdfs:comment>
