  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#Profile">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Describes the existence of a profile. The MRID is usually defined as a static value by the document or artifact that defines the contents of the profile and the rules for using the profile.</rdfs:comment>
