    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Selector for frequency/shaft speed input (isFreq). true = speed (same meaning as InputSignaKind.rotorSpeed) false = frequency (same meaning as InputSignalKind.busFrequency). Typical value = true (same meaning as InputSignalKind.rotorSpeed).</rdfs:comment>
