  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#PssWECC">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Dual input power system stabilizer, based on IEEE type 2, with modified output limiter defined by WECC (Western Electricity Coordinating Council, USA).</rdfs:comment>
