  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#UnderexcLimIEEE2">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Type UEL2 underexcitation limiter which has either a straight-line or multi- segment characteristic when plotted in terms of machine reactive power output vs. real power output. Reference: IEEE UEL2 421.5-2005, 10.2 (limit characteristic lookup table shown in Figure 10.4 (p 32)).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61970.ttl" />
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">UnderexcLimIEEE2</rdfs:label>
