    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Minimum xWTref (qWTref or delta uWTref) request from the plant controller (xrefmin) (&lt; WindPlantReactiveControlIEC.xrefmax). It is a project-dependent parameter.</rdfs:comment>
